# Everything is excluded, and the image's inputs are named below. A file has to
# be listed to reach the build, so nothing new can enter the context by being
# forgotten — not a .env holding real client credentials, not an editor's
# directory, not the history in .git.
*

!app/
!migrations/
!alembic.ini
!pyproject.toml
!poetry.lock

# The last matching line wins, so these come after the inclusions above. Byte
# cache from a host running a different interpreter is worse than useless in
# the image.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
